<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">&nbsp;</span><strong>Earth</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Earth, our home, is the third planet from the sun. It is the only planet known to have an atmosphere containing free oxygen, oceans of liquid water on its surface, and, of course, life.</span></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Earth is the fifth largest of the planets in the solar system &mdash; smaller than the four gas giants, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus and Neptune, but larger than the three other rocky planets,</span></h2>
